  <item>
    <title>Vol.23 香椿香菜折耳根，以及那些人类又爱又恨的食物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67de6276dd11f9c8c1560597</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67de6276dd11f9c8c1560597</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Mar 2025 07:23:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>香椿芽引发的激烈战争这是一期欢乐程度很高的减熵实验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期节目中，阿西野和翠西老师带着飞行嘉宾Kayla，共同探讨了那些让人又爱又恨的食物。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8jxT8Vjhm9hX_YEU7Y73BDWM-9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（阿西野在家里种了两盆香菜）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtKWJGG4g_oT6XGjSSeCDVm8THyl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（引起战争的就是这一包香椿芽，好贵60块/斤）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a>:【阿西野】香椿是春天特有的浪漫美味！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a>:香菜、葱、姜与蒜的味觉体验！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">00:17:04</a>:【翠西】我在重庆一辈子没吃过折耳根</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">00:34:20</a>:重庆的豌杂面：品味调料与酱的绝妙融合！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">00:42:55</a>:口感极端组的脑花与肥肠：下水的新世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">00:51:30</a>:【阿西野】我被鱼鳔崩了一脸：犹豫就会败北！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3601">01:00:01</a>:探寻粤菜中的粽子风味：咸肉粽的魅力与口感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">01:08:40</a>:口感之争：咸豆浆与甜豆腐脑儿的味觉对决！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4637">01:17:17</a>:榴莲：爱它的人欲罢不能，讨厌的人退避三舍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5149">01:25:49</a>:火锅麻酱与香油，两个我都要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5665">01:34:25</a>:美味与残忍的较量：蚕蛹的美味你想象不到</span></p>]]></description>
