    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">00:02:21</a>:观影回忆：动画片儿的魅力与挑战——成人的选择与孩子的裹挟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="312">00:05:12</a>:成长中的陪伴：动画片与课外知识拓展</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">00:10:48</a>:【翠西】的角色转换：《哪吒2》绝对是今年春节中国父母必读的育儿经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">00:16:18</a>:【翠西】中国传统文化与中国电影的完美结合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1295">00:21:35</a>:【阿西野】父辈们的形象：李靖、敖光、申正道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">00:27:07</a>:【翠西】爱与勇气：父亲在儿童成长中的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">00:32:36</a>:【关于反抗与解放】父亲形象的探索与觉醒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">00:38:00</a>:【反派形象简单处理】：无量仙翁是否过于脸谱化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">00:43:27</a>:个人英雄到团队反抗：《哪吒》中角色的挣扎与奋斗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2932">00:48:52</a>:自信表达文化魅力：方言在影视作品中的成功应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3587">00:59:47</a>:《哪吒二》票房惊艳亮相，中国动画制作迈向新高</span></p>]]></description>
