  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 年味儿又回来了！川渝乡村「流水席」的浩大场面</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6794886bd74435e4a3ab9c3b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6794886bd74435e4a3ab9c3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jan 2025 06:59:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年春节为什么来得特别快（除了它真的来得比较早以外😁）？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期“减熵实验”中，阿西野、阿格丽丝、翠西三位主播分享了对今年春节的感受：</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿西野说，今年春节，年味儿变浓了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿格丽丝悲观底色上的正向人格钟爱“辞旧迎新”这样的节点，纯纯就是开心~</span></p><span></span><p><span>翠西说，“时间的速度”与年纪大小成长比，年纪越大，越觉得时间过得太快。再次认真推荐《时间贫困》，据说里面有时间&amp;幸福的窍门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>翠西的认真推荐，还有四川乡村热闹的流水席，这将是本期的重头戏！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoUflvADcj_lSiSHKCBTTm_vqAMK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">00:02:03</a>:今年春节特别期待，但我搞不赢来迎接它，你呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">00:06:16</a>:时间的残酷游戏：我们为什么感受时间的扭曲？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">00:11:07</a>:自由支配时间与幸福感：研究发现两到五小时是最佳幸福区间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1138">00:18:58</a>:年味儿回来了：寻找内心的平衡与生活的底色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">00:25:22</a>:乡下结婚的热闹场面：流水席和淳朴的乡情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1891">00:31:31</a>:美味佳肴背后的故事：乡村宴席的秩序与分工</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2263">00:37:43</a>:乡里乡情，人心温暖：一场婚礼引发的感动之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">00:44:22</a>:春节：城乡规则的碰撞与留守儿童的幸福之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">00:50:43</a>:回家的迫切感：但凡再晚一天，那机票就不是我能买得起的了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3412">00:56:52</a>:从家中团年到外面就餐：过年方式的转变与思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3802">01:03:22</a>:重庆解放碑下的家族聚会：热闹周末和美味年夜饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4183">01:09:43</a>:跨代而生，神奇的家庭结构：舅舅、姨和外公的奇妙关系</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6602b8c81519139e4fb74fec/lhod4Pob6-EWKCzpnGDdeA9BPr5e.m4a" length="111046736" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:33</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLcxy8GBnssTj_T0nSMkUlf22e4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.15 牛市和我这仨瓜俩枣有啥关系｜三个投资小白的理财之路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670ccb87db2cf8275715fb77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670ccb87db2cf8275715fb77</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 07:43:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>新一波锣鼓喧天的牛市，你们冲进股市开户了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>普通人兜儿里的仨瓜俩枣和这波牛市到底有啥关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span>听听阿西野、阿格里斯、翠西三个投资小白的理财之路吧！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTT8B4ywWcvUcZbIsO-EOJlGs7c.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">00:03:45</a>翠西：这是一个全国人民都不想放假的国庆节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">00:05:08</a>证券公司客户经理：追着买基金到开不了户，就隔了个国庆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a>阿西野：还记得余额宝年化收益率7.2％的时候吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="645">00:10:45</a>每个月一定有结余的理财习惯，阿格丽丝工作三年自己买了第一辆车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">00:16:08</a>【专业人士】资本市场红火的时候，亏损的人数比资本市场低迷的时候更多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">00:23:00</a>【实验样本1】凭运气赚到的钱，都会凭实力亏掉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">00:32:00</a> 阿西野每周会定投，现在怎么样了？（他把软件删了）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">00:34:50</a> 从20岁开始每天买一瓶矿泉水，60岁时你花掉了100万！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3257">00:54:17</a>【专业人士】以定投的方式参与资本市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3505">00:58:25</a>定投的“微笑曲线”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">01:05:50</a> 翠西：财迷是怎么做到不割肉的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a> 阿西野提醒：支付软件代销基金手续费比基金公司直销的要高哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4480">01:14:40</a>【实验样本2】小白基金定投2720天的心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5060">01:24:20</a> 鸡贼孩子阿西野的黄金投资理念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5790">01:36:30</a>【专业人士】基金定投何时卖出？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6020">01:40:20</a> 你存下的“裸辞基金”实际上是你存下了“选择的权利”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkozapj-uBEzJp7WIN7IJGrQ0yip.m4a" length="102939635" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:46:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHrNPq3aq9WWsb0NpeT5YGGGQ_d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.14 毕业季｜是终点也是起点：终身学习才是人生必杀技</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667c37b4c37399840c55b1ca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667c37b4c37399840c55b1ca</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Jun 2024 15:45:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>知识付费、年轻人的夜校……终身学习热潮来袭？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“活到老学到老”，它究竟是一句套话还是历久弥新的真相？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“终身学习”你熟吗？什么是终身学习？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你想要达成终身学习，你拥有实现它的能力了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>“减熵实验”的实验员们认为：终身学习的能力很可能是当代最重要的“一技之长”，</span></p><span></span><p><span>因此我们找到了一些学习典范来和大家分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果学习能让我们快乐，那鸡娃很可能不如鸡自己来得有趣；</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们看到智能时代对老年人如此不友好的时候，</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了搀扶，还得警惕。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次，让我们一起来聊一聊学习，希望我们都能够又有一点精进。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期你将听到：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>：学校里面学的东西完全没用？翠西的“打脸”来得太快了😁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>：想要写作文不难？阿格丽丝是这么练出来的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a>：在学校里学会的应该是“学习能力”，而不是“技能”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a>：传媒大学是如何教会了翠西“自由”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a>：而清华大学教育你：“每天锻炼一小时，健康工作50年”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a>：自驾50个小时出去玩牌比天天自己在家玩牌可能要先进一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">20:30</a>：总是对自己的能力设限，可能是终身学习的一颗“绊脚石”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">22:50</a>：只用黑键弹琴的翠西母亲竟然是音乐老师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a>：阿格丽丝最近的困扰：如何“授人以渔”——别再问我要“鱼”啦！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a>：你迷恋“考证”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">46:31</a>：翠西如何放下“老传媒人”的鄙视链，接受“某音”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a>：实验样本一：终身学习的“大力姐”值得我们每一个人学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3430">57:10</a>：“学习能力”是现代人最重要的“一技之长”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3920">01:05:20</a>：阿西野和翠西教你雅思“秘籍”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">01:12:00</a>：多少人终身学习的能力被扼杀在三年级？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4535">01:15:35</a>：考到10级就拿着菜刀把家里的钢琴砸了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5298">01:28:18</a>：实验样本二：85后创业妈妈：就是现在开始学，现在开始做就够了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5795">01:36:35</a>：行动力会给你物质反馈，成为你下一次继续学习的条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5875">01:37:55</a>：“终身学习”会让你快乐，这是“职场”常常呈现不了的样貌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6080">01:41:20</a>：鸡娃不如鸡自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6290">01:44:50</a>：现在：智能时代对老人不友好；未来：失去学习能力=举步维艰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6550">01:49:10</a>：“我年纪大了”未来可能行不通了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6784">01:53:04</a>：学习没有冤枉路，走过的每一步都算数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6820">01:53:40</a>：阿西野内心的呼喊：希望每一位父母都能学习与孩子一起成长</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrxLlGzmZbO6LTF2ecUYqQ-dZowe.m4a" length="111686936" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:55:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHrNPq3aq9WWsb0NpeT5YGGGQ_d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 我们为什么都不会(敢)谈恋爱了：斗胆聊聊“亲密关系”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666af932c26e396a3693c172</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666af932c26e396a3693c172</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 13 Jun 2024 13:50:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本来想聊“毕业季就是分手季？”,奈何收集到0投稿……</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近被《玫瑰的故事》刷屏，减熵实验年龄跨越20年的三人决定浅聊一下“亲密关系进化论”~</span></p><span></span><p><span>婚姻是爱情的坟墓吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>亦或“亲密关系的核心是友谊”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>前任该做朋友还是“亡夫”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人类的每一项“本能”或许都是需要学习的一种“能力”，包括亲密关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>已然看不出曾经“恋爱脑”过的翠西贡献了自己的失恋故事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但她告诉你：没关系，亲密关系最重要的战友是自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一点也不悲伤，</span></p><span></span><p><span>认清了人生“孤独”本质的人才不孤单，</span></p><span></span><p><span>依然勇敢去爱的才是浪漫主义的英雄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家找到真爱，同时最爱自己！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">0:40</a> 三个主播最近的状态：比较忙非常down</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">2:35</a> 恭喜实验员土豆喜提美国大厂offer</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">6:52</a> 大学生课堂回应“婚姻是坟墓”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 亲密关系的社会时钟在松动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 一个叫“花生”的珠宝设计师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 亲密关系可以是两个三角形的相遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 《亲密关系的核心是友谊》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 建立亲密关系是一种需要学习的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 年纪越小情感试错成本越低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 翠西的失恋经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 一位新闻故事里的女士</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3435">57:15</a> 每个人都要面对亲密关系终结后的人生重启</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 热烈欢迎“铁子”听友丝儿来了重庆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3640">01:00:40</a>《玫瑰的故事》为什么要买亦舒的版权然后改到面目全非？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3710">01:01:50</a>“师太”亦舒：美的最高境界是“美而不自知”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3980">01:06:20</a>曾经的“恋爱脑”翠西在婚姻中得到滋养，这是一个幸福的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4189">01:09:49</a>《荼蘼》：因为你很委屈，所以我连说我委屈的权利都没有。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4680">01:18:00</a>你想用一段关系来解救另一段关系 只会是一个麻烦叠加另一个麻烦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a>“我和你妈掉进水里”首先救你的人才适合婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5500">01:31:40</a>“你能想到的全部理由都是我和你分手的原因”这段关系已经衰亡。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu3rGaaeCs-RxwCuqwm1o3w60127.m4a" length="89825822" type="audio/mp4"/>
