    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>纯回忆向！70后翠西👩‍🏫，80后阿格丽丝👩🏻‍💻，90后阿西野🙆🏻‍♂️。来自三个年代的动画片记忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《灌篮高手》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《猫眼三姐妹》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《哆啦A梦》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《樱桃小丸子》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《名侦探柯南》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《龙珠》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《圣斗士星矢》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《数码宝贝》（“飞帽杀”让阿西野泪洒当场）</span></p>]]></description>
