  <item>
    <title>vol.11 聊聊职场叭（下）：我们找到了璩(qú)静的反义词</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645ff70251bd96e6ccd9f23</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6645ff70251bd96e6ccd9f23</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 12:43:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>璩静的“狼性”发言是否让你心生畏惧呢？别怕，我们找到了璩静的反义词。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，这也是一期给阿西野找工作的节目！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>走入“新手村”，你揣好通关的锦囊了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期的职场故事，来自职场新人、高管、HR以及企业老板，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有在职场频频受挫，又努力求生的三位主播，</span></p><span></span><p><span>有委屈，也有温暖，有成长，也有反思。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你的工龄是0还是20+，</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起，勇敢面对职场吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">2:12</a> 【实验样本1】张大洋：职业规划没必要宏大🌚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="407">6:47</a> 翠西：可以有计划，但别有具体规划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="506">8:26</a> 现在的很多岗位，在10年前根本都不存在，那未来呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 翠西：大学老师来跟你们谈谈专业选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a> 阿西野：别把自己搞得太专业化，斜杠一点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1428">23:48</a> 阿西野：没错，我们只要三年工作经历的应届本科毕业生～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1522">25:22</a> 【本期重头戏】阿西野多变的职业规划：记者-设计师-老板-剪辑师-科研工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1925">32:05</a> 阿西野的逆天考研经历：一个月上岸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 阿西野：工作没必要选自己热爱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">50:38</a>【实验样本2】神仙老板牛大圣：她职场劈腿，我待她如一😂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3427">57:07</a> 翠西：找工作就像谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3641">60:41</a> 阿西野：谈恋爱也得像找工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3715">61:55</a> 翠西：优秀的老板应该这样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4090">68:10</a> 翠西：给自己多一点“容错率”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4639">77:19</a> 【实验样本3】资深HR的职场建议（略爹味儿，但很有用）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5173">86:13</a> 阿格丽丝：当面说好话。阿西野：背后更该说好话！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5272">87:52</a> 阿西野：自带的职场技能一定能帮到你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5552">92:32</a> 阿格丽丝：能不能跟同事交朋友？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5608">93:28</a> 阿西野：跟上一家公司的同事成为朋友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6079">101:19</a> 阿西野：阿西野的简历，各位HR请往这戳！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llEhGFHDvx63CxpGcsp7CyZWHFeu.m4a" length="101190666" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:44:16</itunes:duration>
