  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 聊聊职场叭（上）：岸上的工作也那样</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6644c27a251bd96e6c90ca5f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6644c27a251bd96e6c90ca5f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 14:11:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>毕业生准备好进入职场了吗？大BOSS们准备好迎接新人了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近火爆互联网的“狼性”发言是否让你心生畏惧呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>走入“新手村”，你揣好通关的锦囊了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期的职场故事，来自职场新人、高管、HR以及企业老板，</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有在职场频频受挫，又努力求生的三位主播，</span></p><span></span><p><span>有委屈，也有温暖，有成长，也有反思。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你的工龄是0还是20+，</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起，勇敢面对职场吧！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期你会听到：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 阿西野的博士读不成了😭😭😭回流职场💪！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 阿西野竟然觉得璩（qu）静说的对？！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>聊聊璩（</span><strong><span>qú</span></strong><span>）静</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 【特别样本】听听同行怎么说璩静这件事儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1794">29:54</a> 阿西野：只要有人，那水就浅不了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1867">31:07</a> 翠西：我们读不懂璩静，那是因为我们“道不同”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 本期模仿秀高光！！！！！“让子弹飞一会”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1927">32:07</a> 阿格丽丝：都2024了，鬼才相信狼性文化</span></p><span></span><h2><span>职场的暖心瞬间哦</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a> 【实验样本1】学会“好人先告状”！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2557">42:37</a> 翠西：领导给了个好的开端，几年后就能收获一个成熟体职场人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2838">47:18</a> 翠西：职场限定技能——撒泼！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 翠西让单位一把手帮自己打签到卡。牛！</span></p><span></span><h2><span>可爱的职场老板</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3599">59:59</a> 我们“强行”给保时捷车主募捐了两件冬衣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4155">69:15</a> 阿格丽丝：我的职场暴怒瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4247">70:47</a> 翠西：屁股决定脑袋的职场铁律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4434">73:54</a> 阿西野：不干活你就提供点情绪价值</span></p><span></span><h2><span>岸上的工作怎么样？</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4577">76:17</a> 岸上的风景emmmm 也就那样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4955">82:35</a> 阿西野：岸上的领导可能就是这么想的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5245">87:25</a> 翠西：文山会海不是说说而已哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5490">91:30</a> 阿西野：岸上的规则其实是很透明的</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgKjTKCG5b25ZFAqV8-T1NXT5Rti.m4a" length="94102472" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHrNPq3aq9WWsb0NpeT5YGGGQ_d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 五一特辑｜我羡慕了吗?!——海外的他们是这样度假的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6637e2ff03bcdd73a9a59362</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6637e2ff03bcdd73a9a59362</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 May 2024 19:50:23 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>五月六日凌晨一点，我们结束了假期，录完了之前准备好的五一特辑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>*由于这一集是本期《减熵实验》的下半集，我们强烈建议你从Vol. 8 开始收听哦～</span></p><span></span><p><span>本集你还会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vol9. 时间轴（下）：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> 翠西在美国高速路收费站误入ETC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 加拿大公交车司机把满载的公交车停在路边去买咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 同事在美国提醒翠西，“他们有枪”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="743">12:23</a> “打卡游”和“躺平游”的共性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> “从众就能让我觉得安心”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 露营是澳洲人民的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2297">38:17</a> 人到中年特别害怕被打乱的生活节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a> 南山“放牛村”是翠西在这个五一找到的“身边的远方”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 加拿大的很多假日都在礼拜一，根本不用调休</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> 最具松弛感的法国人民不调休的方式是过“桥假”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3364">56:04</a> 在美国高校工作六年左右就可以申请带薪一年的“学术休假”</span></p><span></span><p><span>“瑞典乏味的公休假”、“在美国互联网大厂为狗狗请假”、“德国的火车不靠谱”、“澳洲星空下的篝火”、“尽量把节日安排在周一的加拿大”和“长达一年带薪休假的高校学术休假”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这些“外面的假期”，带你去到更远的远方。</span></p>]]></description>
